        "text_eng": "For the following equation,\n\n\\(\\frac{1}{10}(x) + \\frac{1}{5}(y) = \\frac{1}{6}(x) + \\frac{1}{10}(y) + 5\\). If \\(y = 250\\), find \\(x = ?\\)",
