        "text_eng": "M, N and O are three cooperative housing societies and m, n and o are points that indicate their gates respectively. m is positioned exactly towards south of n and these two points are 2 km apart. By joining points m, n and o, a right angled isosceles triangle is formed. Suraj walks from n to m, then turns to his left through 45° starts walking towards o and stops exactly to the southeast of n. Select the option that indicated distance covered by Suraj and his position with respect to o.",
